        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. REFUSE TO PROCEED WITHOUT UNION\nREPRESENTATION. If you are denied this right, stay in the room but remain silent.\n3. DO NOT MAKE ANY WRITTEN OR VERBAL STATEMENT OF GUILT OR INNOCENCE. Making NO statement is the most appropriate action.",
